  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 802.11 Certified crop advisor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 802.11 “Certified crop advisor” means an individual certified by the American Society of Agronomy under the Certified Crop Adviser or Certified Professional Agronomist certification programs.\n\nSource. #10998, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36 (formerly Env-Wq 802.09)",
